<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Geffen to buy 51 percent of Aida.</title>
<headline>Geffen to buy 51 percent of Aida.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firm Aida Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that it has agreed to sell 51 percent of its shares to Lew Geffen and/or a consortium of which he forms a part.</p>
<p>The offer is priced at 85 cents a share.</p>
<p>The deal is conditional upon Geffen rasing 4.4 million rand and regulatory apporval.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
